<h2>Centralizing Customer Support Through HubSpot</h2> 
<p>The Challenge<br>
Our customer service team was juggling messages across multiple platforms — website, Amazon, social media, reviews, and returns/warranty forms. With no unified system, follow‑ups were delayed, conversations were missed, and customer satisfaction suffered.</p>
<p>What I Built</p>
<ol>
  <li>Integrated all customer touchpoints into HubSpot, funneling every inquiry into one shared inbox</li>
  <li>Set up conversation tracking so reps could close, tag, and monitor every interaction</li>
  <li>Created a ticketing system for warranties and returns using structured forms to capture required data</li>
  <li>Standardized workflows to ensure consistent handling and faster resolution times</li>
  </ol>
<p>The Impact</p>
<ol>
  <li>15+ hours saved per week for the customer service team</li>
  <li>35% increase in customer satisfaction, measured through feedback surveys</li>
  <li>Zero missed messages, thanks to centralized tracking</li>
  <li>New insights for product and CX improvements by analyzing recurring customer questions</li>
</ol>
